# Not committed on purpose. This package has zero runtime dependencies, so the
# lockfile pins nothing that ends up in the published artifact. Keeping it only
# caused CI failures: playwright (a transitive dev dependency of @n8n/node-cli)
# optionally depends on the macOS-only fsevents, and npm on macOS drops that
# entry from the lockfile when its native build fails, which Linux npm then
# rejects. Build reproducibility comes from exact version pins in
# devDependencies instead.
package-lock.json
